To whom it may concern,                                 September 9, 1992

I have enclosed a copy of my game for the IBM PC & Compatible market.
Please add the program on the enclosed disk to your Shareware catalog.
The specifications are as follows. Thankyou for your time.

PROGRAM NAME: DAYMARE 1
FILE NAME: DAYMARE1.EXE
REGISTRATION FEE: $16
PUBLISHER: JING GAMEWARE, P.O. BOX 281, BEAVERTON, OR, 97075-0281
AUTHOR: JIM TODD
PREFERRED BBS FILENAME: DAYMARE1.ZIP
SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS: IBM PC or COMPATIBLE, 512K memory (378K free memory),
CGA graphics or better, MOUSE required.
An 80286 processor or faster recommended.
SHORT DESCRIPTION: A solo RPG game set in the first person viewing mode.
DESCRIPTION: "Daymare 1" is a solo role playing game with the object of
defeating the ultimate bad guy. The dungeon is viewed as if you were
actually there. Objects can be picked up, dropped, thrown, or otherwise
manipulated. Spells may be hurled. Players may face ancient dragons,
vampiric wizards, and many other assorted nasties. Game is designed for
ages 12 through adult.
CONDITIONS UNDER WHICH THIS SOFTWARE MAY BE DISTRIBUTED:
Individual users may freely copy this software and share it with friends
and family.
Groups, BBS's, and Distributors may distribute this software subject to
the following conditions:
        1) The files on each disk may not be modified or adapted in any
        way. All the files provided on the disk must be distributed
        together. Individual files or groups of files may not be sold
        separately. Addition files may be added and this software may be
        combined on a disk with other programs.
        2) This software may not be represented as anything other than
        shareware. The fact that this is shareware must be include in
        any ad or packaging that is used to market or display the disk.
        3) If the files are to be zipped for modem transmission, then
        the files should all be included in the file "DAYMARE1.ZIP".
        The following command will do this if you have PKZIP installed
        on your computer and you are in the correct directory.
             PKZIP DAYMARE1.ZIP DAYMARE1.EXE *.DAT *.DOC *.BAT
        4) You must immediately stop selling or distributing copies of
        this program upon notice from the author or Jing Gameware.


